-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Target model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The draft model was trained on greedy outputs and hidden states of
mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-3B-2507 (revision 3060fe34b35ba5d44202ce9ff3c097642914f8f3),
Copyright Mistral AI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-3B-2507
The draft is used together with the target model's own token embeddings and LM head,
which are loaded from the target checkpoint and are not modified.
Reference: Voxtral, arXiv:2507.13264.

Method: DFlash block-diffusion speculative drafting, arXiv:2602.06036. The checkpoint
uses the public DFlash checkpoint format (z-lab/dflash, MIT License).

